Aale Nabi Pe Aada Yeh Zulm Dharahe Hai<br>
Sukhe Gaale Pe Sheh Ke Khanjar Chalarahe Hai<br>
<br>
1.Padhte Hai Haq Ka Kalma Hai Naam Ke Musalman<br>
Jo Run Me Shah-e-Deen Ke Dil Ku Dukharahe Hai<br>
<br>
2.Akber Tadhap Rahe Hai Dil Par Seena Laagi Hai<br>
Nazrou Me Hai Andhera Sheh Ladhkhada Rahe Hai<br>
<br>
3.Karke Aadaye Shukar Mabood Run Me Sarwar<br>
Peedhi Me Noujawan Ka Laasha Utharahe Hai<br>
<br>
4.Soula Paher Ke Pyase Asghar Ku Karbala Me<br>
Teer-e-Sitam Ka Zalim Paani Pilarahe Hai<br>
<br>
5.Shabbir Dil Sambhale Aansu Baharehe Hai<br>
Apne Pisar Ki Turbat Run Me Banarehe Hai<br>
<br>
6.Zalim Yeh Jante Hain Hai Tashnalab Sakina<br>
Paani Dikha Dikha Kar Phir Bhi Baharahe Hai
